*> vybe-test: cobol/programs/math_functions_program
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_programs.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MATHPROG.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PI     PIC 9(1)V9(10) VALUE 3.1415926535.
01 WS-R      PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ANGLE  PIC 9(3) VALUE 45.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION SQRT(144).
    DISPLAY "SQRT(144) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION ABS(-42).
    DISPLAY "ABS(-42) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION MAX(10 20 30 40 50).
    DISPLAY "MAX = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION MIN(10 20 30 40 50).
    DISPLAY "MIN = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION SIN(WS-PI).
    DISPLAY "SIN(PI) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION COS(0).
    DISPLAY "COS(0) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION LOG(1).
    DISPLAY "LOG(1) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION EXP(1).
    DISPLAY "EXP(1) = " WS-R.
    COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION MEAN(10 20 30).
    DISPLAY "MEAN = " WS-R.
    STOP RUN.

